	6>Instructions :
	----------------

_ScreenOpen:			Open An AGA Screen for displaying.
					In	:	d0.w=SCREEN
							d1.w=XSIZE
							d2.w=YSIZE
							d3.w=DEPTH
							d4.w=SCREEN TYPE (unused for the moment)
					Out	:	a0.l=SCREENBASE

_ScreenClose:			Close a previously opened screen.
					In	:	d0.w=SCREEN
					Out	:	/

_ScreenBase:			Check base of a memory bank
					In	:	d0.w=SCREEN
					Out	:	a0.l=SCREENBASE
;							d0.l=ERROR (if error occured)
;							a1.l=ERROR MESSAGE(if error occured)

